922} plus at most one idiosyncratic extra (460, 1016, 1555, 195, 100). Comparing the group's aggregate contacts on the two sides of any candidate change point with a \u00b15000 half-window yields a Jaccard \u2248 0.94\u20131.0 \u2014 no old set is retired and no new set is recruited.\n\nSo this is a rotation of *which member* carries the traffic, not a switch of *whom* the group contacts. There is no old-contacts\u2192new-contacts replacement anywhere in [45074, 75074].\n\n```json\n{\n  \"task_id\": \"t_8155967f\",\n  \"decision\": \"absent\",\n  \"mechanism\": \"regime_switch\",\n  \"entities\": [114, 140, 182, 293, 356, 654, 731, 959, 1107, 1260, 1268, 1311],\n  \"window\": [45074, 75074],\n  \"confidence\": 0.82,\n  \"evidence\": [\n    {\"trace_id\": \"step_02\", \"role\": \"support\"},\n    {\"trace_id\": \"step_03\", \"role\": \"confounder_control\"},\n    {\"trace_id\": \"step_10\", \"role\": \"support\"},\n    {\"trace_id\": \"step_11\", \"role\": \"support\"},\n    {\"trace_id\": \"step_13\", \"role\": \"support\"},\n    {\"trace_id\": \"step_15\", \"role\": \"support\"},\n    {\"trace_id\": \"step_17\", \"role\": \"support\"},\n    {\"trace_id\": \"step_19\", \"role\": \"support\"},\n    {\"trace_id\": \"step_21\", \"role\": \"support\"},\n    {\"trace_id\": \"step_22\", \"role\": \"support\"},\n    {\"trace_id\": \"step_23\", \"role\": \"support\"},\n    {\"trace_id\": \"step_24\", \"role\": \"support\"},\n    {\"trace_id\": \"step_25\", \"role\": \"support\"},\n    {\"trace_id\": \"step_28\", \"role\": \"support\"},\n    {\"trace_id\": \"step_29\", \"role\": \"support\"},\n    {\"trace_id\": \"step_26\", \"role\": \"support\"},\n    {\"trace_id\": \"step_27\", \"role\": \"support\"},\n    {\"trace_id\": \"step_30\", \"role\": \"support\"},\n    {\"trace_id\": \"step_31\", \"role\": \"confounder_control\"},\n    {\"trace_id\": \"step_04\", \"role\": \"support\"},\n    {\"trace_id\": \"step_05\", \"role\": \"confounder_control\"},\n    {\"trace_id\": \"ste